            "review_title": "Review at Tâm Hậu Vegetarian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Maps09652456889\n2 contributions\n0\nVegetarian Treasure Restaurant 🍴\nJul 2026 • Family\nVegetarian food is super delicious, I can eat it for a whole month without getting tired of it. The cold salad I love and the grilled tofu are also delicious; the other dishes are good too. I've already introduced colleagues to eat; they are all regular customers. Affordable, quite cheap. I will always support you~\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten October 7, 2026\nTâm Hậu Q\nCảm ơn bạn rất nhiều vì đã lựa chọn Tâm Hậu cho bữa ăn của mình! Sự hài lòng của bạn về món ăn và khẩu phần lớn là động lực to lớn cho quán. Chúc bạn và gia đình luôn an lạc! \n\nThank you so much for choosing Tam Hau! Your satisfaction with our delicious dishes and generous portions means the world to us. Wishing you and your family peace and happiness!\nRead more\nWritten October 11, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
